<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Put this week's sessions in Swimly</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">

    <div style="background: #111827; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #00ff90;">Swimly</h1>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 30px 20px;">
      <p style="font-size: 18px; margin-top: 0;">Hi {{#if firstName}}{{firstName}}{{else}}there{{/if}},</p>

      <p>You set up {{activationClubName}} a couple of days ago. The single most useful next step is to put this week's training sessions in.</p>

      <p>It takes about five minutes: pick a squad, add the days and times you train, and you are done. Once your sessions are in, registers, reminders and attendance all start working for you.</p>

      <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
        <a href="{{sessionsUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #00ff90; color: #111827; font-weight: 700; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;">Add this week's sessions</a>
      </div>

      <p>If your training schedule is complicated, or something does not fit, just reply to this email and I will sort it with you.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
        Cheers,<br>
        <strong>Mike</strong><br>
        <span style="color: #64748B;">Founder of Swimly</span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: #F8FAFC; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #64748B; font-size: 13px;">
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;">&copy; {{year}} Swimly. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0;"><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color: #64748B; text-decoration: underline;">Unsubscribe</a></p>
    </div>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
